    readTime: "8 min",
    excerpt: "Level 1 is AI as a drafting tool. Level 2 is AI as infrastructure — systems that run whether you're paying attention or not. Most couples and vendors are stuck at Level 1. The ones seeing real results have moved to Level 2.",
    seoTitle: "AI Weddings: Level 1 vs Level 2 — Use AI Tools Right | Weddings.io",
    metaDescription: "Most couples & vendors use AI weddings tools at Level 1 (drafting). Level 2 users get 473 hours back per year. Here's the shift — and how to make it.",
