      "The monthly price is flat by hardcoded population bracket. Cities up to 2,000,000 population are $10/month. A city from 2,000,001 to 3,000,000 is $20/month, 3,000,001 to 4,000,000 is $30/month, and so on up to the $290/month cap for 29,000,001+. There is no premium slot, no second slot, no featured placement, and no ranking advantage purchased through higher spend.",
